    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The square’s rostrum stretches 66 meters long and 37 meters wide, once housing the Tiananmen Guards.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.chinaxiantour.com/tiananmen-square.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Located at the intersection of the central axis and Chang’an Avenue, Tiananmen Square sits at Beijing’s heart.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.chinaxiantour.com/tiananmen-square.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Over five centuries, Tiananmen Square has witnessed both imperial ceremonies and modern protests, reflecting China’s evolving history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.chinaxiantour.com/tiananmen-square.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "It is the largest public square in China, covering more than 3.5 million square feet.",
